@1 = ~You're still alive? No matter. I will finish what my minions could not.~
@2 = ~Why are you doing this? Who really are you?~
@3 = ~I shall fight you until my last breath, if you force me.~
@4 = ~Hah! If you expect me to waste my breath on soon-to-be casualties, I must sorely disappoint you. Oh, Dark Lord, bestow your great power upon me, to cleanse this place for your return! I shall end your lives in his name! Your souls are his!~
@5 = ~Let's not prolong the inevitable any longer then!~
